        </p>


        <!-- ================= IMAGE 1 ================= -->

        <div class="chairman-image-block">

            <img
                src="/images/chairman1.png.jpeg"
                alt="Chairman - Prestige College"
            >

            <div class="image-caption">

                Chairman Sir

                <span>
                    Prestige Institute of Management and Research, Bhopal
                </span>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= VISIONARY LEADER ================= -->

        <div class="content-section">

            <h2>
                A Visionary Leader
            </h2>

            <p>
                Our Chairman Sir is a visionary leader whose dedication and commitment have
                shaped Prestige Institute of Management and Research into one of the most
                respected educational institutions in Central India. With decades of experience
                in the field of education and administration, he has been the guiding force
                behind the institute's remarkable growth and success.
            </p>

            <p>
                His unwavering belief in the power of education to transform lives has inspired
                thousands of students to dream big and achieve their goals. Under his dynamic
                leadership, PIMR has consistently set new benchmarks in academic excellence,
                research, and holistic development.
            </p>


            <div class="highlight-box">

                <p>
                    "Education is not just about degrees — it is about building character,
                    courage, and compassion."
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= IMAGE 2 ================= -->

        <div class="chairman-image-block">

            <img
                src="/images/chairman2.png.jpeg"
                alt="Chairman - Prestige College"
            >

            <div class="image-caption">

                Chairman Sir with Students

                <span>
                    Inspiring the next generation of leaders
                </span>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= MENTOR ================= -->

        <div class="content-section">

            <h2>
                A Mentor and Guide
            </h2>

            <p>
                Beyond his role as an administrator, our Chairman Sir is a true mentor to
                students, faculty, and staff alike. He firmly believes that every student has
                the potential to become a leader, and he continuously works to create an
                environment where that potential can flourish.
            </p>

            <p>
                His regular interactions with students, his encouragement of innovative ideas,
                and his emphasis on ethical values have made him one of the most respected
                figures in the education community. He leads by example and inspires everyone
                around him to give their best.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= KEY CONTRIBUTIONS ================= -->

        <div class="content-section">

            <h2>
                Key Contributions
            </h2>

            <ul>

                <li>
                    Established PIMR as a center of excellence in management education.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Introduced modern infrastructure and industry-oriented programs.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Promoted research, innovation, and entrepreneurship among students.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Built a strong alumni network that supports the growth of the institution.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Fostered a culture of ethical leadership and social responsibility.
                </li>

            </ul>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= MESSAGE ================= -->

        <div class="content-section">

            <h2>
                Message to Students & Alumni
            </h2>

            <p>
                Our Chairman Sir always reminds students and alumni that success is not just
                measured by personal achievements, but by the positive impact we create in
                the lives of others. He encourages everyone to stay connected with their alma
                mater, to give back to society, and to be ambassadors of the values that PIMR
                stands for.
            </p>


            <div class="highlight-box">

                <p>
                    🌟 "Stay rooted in your values, aim high, and never stop learning."
                    — Chairman Sir
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


